invariant: INV-41
file: src/dnssec.c
catches: proof/prove-one.sh dnssec
reason: verify_rsa hands the RSA check an even exponent, which the RSA
  check's contract forbids and rsa_mont64_public_exp's CH_ASSERT faults
  on. The dnssec proof asserts that the check sees only an odd exponent
  of at least 3, and fails on this edit.

--- old
    if (!rsa_key_field_read(key, key_len, &k) || k.e < 3 || (k.e & 1) == 0 ||
--- new
    if (!rsa_key_field_read(key, key_len, &k) || k.e < 3 ||
